      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Perhaps a generic \"Math\" node with varargs would work for this. The backend would just be a list of these ops that organize appropriately: https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/arithmetic-and-logic-udonvm-ops",
