  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-22T20:13:39.252Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are several operations, particularly arithmetic operations, which may have more than two inputs. Currently, for example, if you need to add 4 numbers, you'd need 3 add nodes.  Adding the ability to expand certain nodes to have an arbitrary number of inputs would simplify this.  In the backend, it could be implemented as a function taking an array; that array being all of the inputs (similar to a C# params argument).",
